1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:13,100
Every single month, thousands of profitable e-commerce merchants wake up to a devastating email from PayPal: Your account has been placed on a 21-day hold, or a rolling reserve.

2
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:16,987
In an instant, incoming revenue is frozen.

3
00:00:16,987 --> 00:00:21,787
Merchants cannot pay suppliers, and payroll is paralyzed.

4
00:00:21,787 --> 00:00:29,250
Worst of all, PayPal risk algorithms never disclose why until it is already too late.

5
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:36,187
This is Thaw: the early-warning and cash-flow shield built specifically for PayPal sellers.

6
00:00:36,187 --> 00:00:41,325
Our promise is simple: Know before PayPal freezes your money.

7
00:00:42,076 --> 00:00:52,513
Instead of leaving merchants in the dark, Thaw continuously analyzes seller account telemetry across six publicly documented underwriting triggers.

8
00:00:52,463 --> 00:01:01,601
In this live store, our Hold Risk Gauge is sitting at 63 out of 100, in the Medium Risk drifting band.

9
00:01:01,601 --> 00:01:21,101
Down in the Cash-Flow Shield, Thaw immediately reveals the financial reality: out of 5,400 dollars in sales, exactly 303 dollars is vulnerable to a 10 percent rolling reserve, locked for up to 21 days by PayPals automated risk bots.

10
00:01:21,868 --> 00:01:24,568
Why is this account drifting?

11
00:01:24,518 --> 00:01:46,780
Thaws AI engine analyzes the deterministic risk signals and breaks them down into plain, actionable English: 14 physical orders dispatched over three days ago are completely missing carrier tracking numbers, and customer dispute rates are trending upward toward the critical 1.5 percent threshold.

12
00:01:46,780 --> 00:01:52,543
In the Action Queue, our agent proposes ranked, prioritized solutions.

13
00:01:52,543 --> 00:02:02,280
Notice the Weight Impact Badge: fulfilling this action removes 6 risk points directly from the missing tracking trigger upon dispatch.

14
00:02:03,052 --> 00:02:08,539
Now, here is our core philosophy: Strict Human-in-the-Loop Guardrails.

15
00:02:08,489 --> 00:02:16,539
The AI proposes actions, but zero money and zero tracking moves without explicit merchant approval.

16
00:02:16,539 --> 00:02:26,989
When the merchant clicks Approve and Execute, the remediation is dispatched instantly through the PayPal Agent Toolkit using Model Context Protocol tools.

17
00:02:26,989 --> 00:02:33,102
Carrier tracking is submitted directly to PayPals live Shipment Tracking API.

18
00:02:33,102 --> 00:02:44,339
Immediately, our risk engine re-evaluates: the risk score drops by 6 points, the cash-flow shield updates, and held funds are cleared for withdrawal.

19
00:02:45,100 --> 00:02:48,937
Merchants can also hedge against future risk.

20
00:02:48,887 --> 00:03:04,287
With our Pre-Promotion Simulator, sellers planning a flash sale can simulate a 2.5 times volume spike and generate pre-notification documentation for PayPal underwriting to prevent automated velocity freezes.

21
00:03:04,287 --> 00:03:07,225
And everything you see is real.

22
00:03:07,225 --> 00:03:26,487
In our Sandbox Proof suite, Thaw executes an authentic five-step verification cycle across PayPals live REST APIs: creating real orders, uploading real shipment trackers, executing refunds, reading disputes, and cryptographically verifying webhook signatures.

23
00:03:27,244 --> 00:03:42,269
Under the hood, Thaw is built on Next.js 14, TypeScript, Prisma, and Zod schema validation, backed by 21 automated unit tests with strict idempotency and refund cap safeguards.

24
00:03:42,219 --> 00:03:44,606
PayPal protects buyers.

25
00:03:44,606 --> 00:03:46,844
Thaw protects merchants.

26
00:03:46,844 --> 00:03:50,044
Know before PayPal freezes your money.

27
00:03:50,044 --> 00:03:51,469
Thank you.

